                        (
                            name: "string",
                            source: Files,
                            optional: false,
                            variadic: false,
                            imported_generator: None,
                        ),
                    ],
                ),
                (
                    names: [
                        "--messages",
                    ],
                    description: Some("The list of messages to be sent. Each message has the format: { \"messageId\": \"string\", \"payload\": \"string\"}. The field names of message payloads (data) that you send to IoT Analytics:   Must contain only alphanumeric characters and undescores (_). No other special characters are allowed.   Must begin with an alphabetic character or single underscore (_).   Cannot contain hyphens (-).   In regular expression terms: \"^[A-Za-z_]([A-Za-z0-9]*|[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_]*)$\".    Cannot be more than 255 characters.   Are case insensitive. (Fields named foo and FOO in the same payload are considered duplicates.)   For example, {\"temp_01\": 29} or {\"_temp_01\": 29} are valid, but {\"temp-01\": 29}, {\"01_temp\": 29} or {\"__temp_01\": 29} are invalid in message payloads"),
                    takes_value: true,
